{"id":"c9464b912634e40b","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-locally-finite.md","title":"Locally Finite Algebra","display":"df-locally-finite — Locally Finite Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-locally-finite","aliases":["93-df-locally-finite"],"display":"df-locally-finite — Locally Finite Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-fcp]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-locally-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-locally-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-locally-finite — Locally Finite Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e8be33143821f05\" href=\"?note=0e8be33143821f05\" title=\"93-df-fcp\">93-df-fcp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e8be33143821f05\" href=\"?note=0e8be33143821f05\" title=\"93-df-fcp\">93-df-fcp</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}_{\\mathbf A}(X))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}_{\\mathbf A}(X))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Local finiteness concerns every finitely generated subalgebra; the quantified similarity type is the one encoded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}]